 task:\n1. Unique artifacts (obtained through Software Reconnaissance-style analysis):\n# Unique Artifacts\n\nUse these unique artifacts as supplemental hints, not as final answers.\n\n## Summary\n- Trace A role: `feature_positive`\n- Trace B role: `feature_negative`\n- Comparison: `trace_a_minus_trace_b`\n- Unique functions in JSON: `12`\n- Unique functions shown here: `9`\n- Target package filter: `numpy`\n\n## Related Files\n- `numpy/lib/stride_tricks.py`: `6` unique function(s)\n- `numpy/core/fromnumeric.py`: `2` unique function(s)\n- `numpy/lib/function_base.py`: `1` unique function(s)\n\n## Artifact Candidates\n- artifact: `numpy/lib/stride_tricks.py:sliding_window_view`\n  - module: `numpy.lib.stride_tricks`\n  - definition: `lines 123-336`\n  - first observed in trace A: `line 302`\n  - observed lines: `301, 302, 303, 305, 307, 308, 311, 312, ...`\n  - trace activity: 22 events, 1 calls, 20 line events, 1 returns, 0 exceptions, max depth 3\n  - sample executed lines:\n    - `line 301`: `window_shape = (tuple(window_shape)`\n    - `line 302`: `if np.iterable(window_shape)`\n    - `line 303`: `else (window_shape,))`\n- artifact: `numpy/lib/stride_tricks.py:as_strided`\n  - module: `numpy.lib.stride_tricks`\n  - definition: `lines 38-114`\n  - first observed in trace A: `line 97`\n  - observed lines: `97, 98, 99, 100, 101, 102, 104, 107, ...`\n  - trace activity: 14 events, 1 calls, 12 line events, 1 returns, 0 exceptions, max depth 4\n  - sample executed lines:\n    - `line 97`: `x = np.array(x, copy=False, subok=subok)`\n    - `line 98`: `interface = dict(x.__array_interface__)`\n    - `line 99`: `if shape is not None:`\n- artifact: `numpy/lib/function_base.py:iterable`\n  - module: `numpy.lib.function_base`\n  - definition: `lines 245-273`\n  - first observed in trace A: `line 269`\n  - observed lines: `269, 270, 271, 272`\n  - trace activity: 7 events, 1 calls, 4 line events, 1 returns, 1 exceptions, max depth 4\n  - sample executed lines:\n    - `line 269`